{"id":"L72x3ZQTw0a3yhvq","meta":{"instanceId":"97f098777c09d070a1b75b286517d932e4d1eb6941b4d7511a04eba023c03569"},"name":"My workflow 3","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"2360d298-364e-4e41-af32-026d70399ab1","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-368,-176],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":880,"content":"## My workflow 3\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow monitors Gmail for new emails, fetches the full message details, and uses an OpenAI-powered LLM chain to analyze the email. It safely parses the AI output as JSON, then routes the email through a switch into different handling paths such as auto-reply, human review notification, or spam handling.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Connect and authorize the Gmail credentials for the trigger, email fetch, labeling, auto-reply, and spam actions.\n- Configure the OpenAI credential/model used by the GPT-4.1 Mini chat model attached to the AI Email Analysis chain.\n- Set the expected AI prompt/output schema so Validate AI JSON can parse the response reliably and the Switch can route on the parsed fields.\n- Configure the Telegram bot credentials and target chat for human review notifications.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the AI classification prompt, Switch rules, Gmail labels, auto-reply message, spam action, and Telegram notification text to match your inbox triage policy."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"c75eedf1-9b5e-4514-95bb-39072e5ef87c","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[192,96],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":816,"height":608,"content":"## Fetch and analyze email\n\nWatches for new Gmail messages, retrieves the full email details, and sends the content into the AI analysis chain using the attached GPT-4.1 Mini model."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"b65e5aa8-d9e2-447a-8659-5e3f6bd0a293","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1040,32],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":384,"height":368,"content":"## Validate and route\n\nParses the AI response safely as JSON, then uses a switch to choose the appropriate handling path based on the analysis result."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"caa7b459-f7e0-4b00-9ca6-f6a7808dcbc5","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1488,-176],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":688,"height":752,"content":"## Apply email outcomes\n\nExecutes the selected branch actions: sending an automatic Gmail reply, labeling messages for human review and notifying Telegram, or marking messages as spam."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"6f1fe2de-6e32-4e4d-831c-c8a9f1656ec8","name":"AI Email Analysis Agent","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","position":[704,224],"parameters":{"text":"=Analyze the following email.\n\nFrom:\n{{ $json.headers.from }}\n\nTo:\n{{ $json.headers.to }}\n\nSubject:\n{{ $json.headers.subject }}\n\nEmail Body:\n{{ $json.html }}\n\n\nReturn the analysis using the required JSON schema.\nTasks:\n\n1. Classify the email into EXACTLY ONE category:\n- Sales\n- Support\n- Billing\n- Security\n- Partnership\n- HR\n- Spam\n- General\n\n2. Determine the priority:\n- High\n- Medium\n- Low\n\n3. Detect the sentiment:\n- Positive\n- Neutral\n- Negative\n\n4. Extract the sender's name.\n\n5. Extract the sender's email address.\n\n6. Extract the company name if available.\n\n7. Write a concise summary (maximum 30 words).\n\n8. Describe the primary action required.\n\n9. Decide whether this email requires human review.\nReturn true or false.\n\n10. Generate a professional email reply draft.\n\nCategory Rules\n\nSales:\nPricing requests, quotations, demos, purchase inquiries.\n\nSupport:\nTechnical issues, bugs, troubleshooting, account problems.\n\nBilling:\nInvoices, subscriptions, payments, refunds.\n\nSecurity:\nPassword resets, login alerts, verification codes, suspicious activity.\n\nPartnership:\nCollaboration requests, affiliate inquiries, business proposals.\n\nHR:\nJob applications, recruitment, hiring.\n\nSpam:\nPromotional emails, phishing attempts, unwanted advertisements.\n\nGeneral:\nAnything that does not match the above categories.\n\nReturn ONLY the JSON required by the output schema.","batching":{},"messages":{"messageValues":[{"message":"=You are an AI Email Assistant for business emails.\n\nYour job is to analyze one email and classify it.\n\nRules:\n\n1. Read the sender, subject, and email body.\n\n2. Classify the email into ONE category:\n- Sales\n- Support\n- Billing\n- Partnership\n- HR\n- Security\n- Spam\n- General\n\n3. Determine the priority:\n- High\n- Medium\n- Low\n\n4. Determine the sentiment:\n- Positive\n- Neutral\n- Negative\n\n5. Decide ONE reply type:\n- Auto Reply\n- Human Review\n- No Reply\n\nUse these rules:\n\nAuto Reply\n- General questions\n- Pricing requests\n- Product information\n- Business hours\n- Thank you emails\n- Meeting confirmations\n\nHuman Review\n- Refunds\n- Complaints\n- Legal issues\n- Payment disputes\n- Security concerns\n- Account access issues\n- VIP customers\n- Custom pricing\n- Partnership negotiations\n- Emails requiring business decisions\n\nNo Reply\n- Spam\n- Marketing newsletters\n- Promotional emails\n- Cold sales outreach\n- Automated notifications\n\n6. Generate a confidence score (0-100).\n\nConfidence guidelines:\n\n95-100\nVery clear classification.\n\n80-94\nLikely correct but some ambiguity.\n\n50-79\nUncertain.\n\nBelow 50\nVery uncertain.\n\n7. Generate a professional suggested reply ONLY if reply_type is \"Auto Reply\".\n\nOtherwise suggested_reply must be an empty string.\n\n8. Write a short summary in one sentence.\n\n9. Extract customer name if available.\n\n10. Extract customer email if available.\n\n11. Extract company name if available.\n\n12. List 0-5 tags.\n\nReturn ONLY the following JSON object.\n\n{\n  \"output\": {\n    \"category\": \"\",\n    \"priority\": \"\",\n    \"confidence\": 0,\n    \"sentiment\": \"\",\n    \"customer_name\": \"\",\n    \"customer_email\": \"\",\n    \"company\": \"\",\n    \"summary\": \"\",\n    \"action_required\": \"\",\n    \"requires_human\": false,\n    \"reply_type\": \"\",\n    \"reply_confidence\": 0,\n    \"suggested_reply\": \"\",\n    \"tags\": []\n  }\n}\n\nRequirements:\n\n- Return ONLY JSON.\n- No markdown.\n- No explanations.\n- No extra text.\n- Every field must exist.\n- Never return null.\n- Unknown values must be \"\".\n- tags must always be an array.\n- confidence and reply_confidence must always be integers.\n- requires_human must always be true or false."}]},"promptType":"define","hasOutputParser":true},"typeVersion":1.9},{"id":"99c59984-5bfc-4f2a-824a-52ae8cc39757","name":"OpenAI GPT-4 Mini","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","position":[688,544],"parameters":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4.1-mini","cachedResultName":"gpt-4.1-mini"},"options":{"maxTokens":-1},"builtInTools":{}},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"jzNv8LiAwHCrDjeC","name":"OpenAi account"}},"typeVersion":1.3},{"id":"55897db1-eb9b-476b-a3e1-5dea50966d51","name":"Get Email from Gmail","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[464,224],"webhookId":"3e4b81a5-3c25-4db7-8670-da97a24ec832","parameters":{"simple":false,"options":{},"messageId":"={{ $json.id }}","operation":"get"},"credentials":{"gmailOAuth2":{"id":"PVieU5Kzr677o4Gk","name":"Gmail OAuth"}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"83a4fe56-4f58-4ea9-a3cf-ce2b8ee105ad","name":"When New Email Arrives","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger","position":[240,224],"parameters":{"filters":{"labelIds":["INBOX"],"readStatus":"unread","includeSpamTrash":false},"pollTimes":{"item":[{"mode":"everyMinute"}]}},"credentials":{"gmailOAuth2":{"id":"PVieU5Kzr677o4Gk","name":"Gmail OAuth"}},"typeVersion":1.4},{"id":"bd66241e-c364-45cc-a9d8-50161c0dfcdb","name":"Auto Reply via Gmail","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[1776,-16],"webhookId":"a131a478-7f88-4aa2-8b87-00c3c9524f95","parameters":{"message":"={{ $json.output.suggested_reply }}","options":{},"emailType":"text","messageId":"={{ $('Get Email from Gmail').item.json.id }}","operation":"reply"},"credentials":{"gmailOAuth2":{"id":"PVieU5Kzr677o4Gk","name":"Gmail OAuth"}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"714ea545-d90e-4807-bd8c-fc1c24f9bb25","name":"Label for Human Review","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[1536,224],"webhookId":"f9e31844-698d-4faa-b5b4-4072db12802d","parameters":{"messageId":"={{ $('Get Email from Gmail').item.json.id }}","operation":"addLabels"},"credentials":{"gmailOAuth2":{"id":"PVieU5Kzr677o4Gk","name":"Gmail OAuth"}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"3b0ec293-e46c-4bc1-8de2-5f43a1d41b45","name":"Send Telegram Notification","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","position":[2032,224],"webhookId":"942b36fa-bcc1-40b0-8b66-8b958944e89f","parameters":{"text":"=🤖 Human Review Required\n\n📧 Subject:\n{{ $('Get Email from Gmail').item.json.headers.subject }}\n\n👤 From:\n{{ $('Get Email from Gmail').item.json.headers.from }}\n\n🏢 Company:\n{{ $('Parse AI Response').item.json.output.company }}      \n\n📂 Category:\n{{ $('Parse AI Response').item.json.output.category }}  \n\n⭐ Priority:\n{{ $('Parse AI Response').item.json.output.priority }}\n\n🎯 Confidence:\n{{ $('Parse AI Response').item.json.output.confidence }}\n\n📝 Summary:\n{{ $('Parse AI Response').item.json.output.summary }}\n\n⚠️ Action Required:\n{{ $('Parse AI Response').item.json.output.requires_human }}\n\n💬 Suggested Reply:\n{{ $('Parse AI Response').item.json.output.suggested_reply }}\n","chatId":"=","additionalFields":{"appendAttribution":false}},"credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"Wwzx1s7ofWnUz2Bh","name":"Wednesday"}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"797f7290-5c42-49d3-85b2-d29e8938f163","name":"Parse AI Response","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1088,224],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Parse AI response safely\nlet raw = $json.text || $json.output || JSON.stringify($json);\n\nif (typeof raw !== 'string') raw = JSON.stringify(raw);\n\nraw = raw.replace(/^```json\\s*/i,'').replace(/^```/,'').replace(/```$/,'').trim();\n\nlet data;\ntry {\n  data = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch {\n  return [{\n    json:{\n      output:{\n        category:\"General\",\n        priority:\"High\",\n        confidence:0,\n        sentiment:\"Neutral\",\n        customer_name:\"\",\n        customer_email:\"\",\n        company:\"\",\n        summary:\"AI output could not be parsed.\",\n        action_required:\"Manual review required.\",\n        requires_human:true,\n        reply_type:\"Human Review\",\n        reply_confidence:0,\n        suggested_reply:\"\",\n        tags:[\"parse_error\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }];\n}\n\nconst o = data.output || data;\n\nconst enums = {\n category:[\"Sales\",\"Support\",\"Billing\",\"Security\",\"Partnership\",\"HR\",\"Spam\",\"General\"],\n priority:[\"High\",\"Medium\",\"Low\"],\n sentiment:[\"Positive\",\"Neutral\",\"Negative\"],\n reply:[\"Auto Reply\",\"Human Review\",\"No Reply\"]\n};\n\nif(!enums.category.includes(o.category)) o.category=\"General\";\nif(!enums.priority.includes(o.priority)) o.priority=\"Medium\";\nif(!enums.sentiment.includes(o.sentiment)) o.sentiment=\"Neutral\";\nif(!enums.reply.includes(o.reply_type)) o.reply_type=\"Human Review\";\n\nreturn [{json:{output:o}}];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"29d1306c-e474-46eb-add7-3e7dcda76aa2","name":"Route by AI Decision","type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","position":[1280,208],"parameters":{"rules":{"values":[{"conditions":{"options":{"version":3,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c342c682-2977-4bd7-b7f2-ce6b23ebb759","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{$json.output.reply_type}}","rightValue":"Auto Reply"}]}},{"conditions":{"options":{"version":3,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"88eefe8d-69a1-475f-910f-e78a52143801","operator":{"name":"filter.operator.equals","type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{$json.output.reply_type}}","rightValue":"Human Review"}]}},{"conditions":{"options":{"version":3,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"2fdb4e76-d14c-48df-ad3d-667a1c71d8c0","operator":{"name":"filter.operator.equals","type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{$json.output.reply_type}}","rightValue":"No Reply"}]}}]},"options":{}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"beeba0ea-d43d-4456-8788-ba30df23232c","name":"Label as Spam in Gmail","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[1808,416],"webhookId":"f9e31844-698d-4faa-b5b4-4072db12802d","parameters":{"messageId":"={{ $('Get Email from Gmail').item.json.id }}","operation":"addLabels"},"credentials":{"gmailOAuth2":{"id":"PVieU5Kzr677o4Gk","name":"Gmail OAuth"}},"typeVersion":2.2}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"ee522077-0797-43b7-bd94-cfdbbedda122","nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"OpenAI GPT-4 Mini":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"AI Email Analysis Agent","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"Parse AI Response":{"main":[[{"node":"Route by AI Decision","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Get Email from Gmail":{"main":[[{"node":"AI Email Analysis Agent","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Route by AI Decision":{"main":[[{"node":"Auto Reply via Gmail","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Label for Human Review","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Label as Spam in Gmail","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Label for Human Review":{"main":[[{"node":"Send Telegram Notification","type":"main","index":0}]]},"When New Email Arrives":{"main":[[{"node":"Get Email from Gmail","type":"main","index":0}]]},"AI Email Analysis Agent":{"main":[[{"node":"Parse AI Response","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}